<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Detecting Data Contamination from Reinforcement Learning Post-training for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Benchmark Detail &amp; Training Settings</span></a></li>
