<th id="A2.T5.4.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Min-K%++<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib52" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhang et al., 2025b</a>)</cite></th>
